you know nan exorcism really isn't as  extraordinary as one might think in fact  every living being has this innate  ability  to become one just in a very particular  way and in this case you can exercise  and banish your boredom by subscribing  to the new world review which will  result in regular hunt onto content  uploaded straight into your youtube feed  hello and welcome to the new order of  your source for everything anime and  manga and today it's hunter hunter time  once more as we are looking into a very  niche brand of menus being that  of ned exorcism and i've spoken about  these figures briefly in a couple of  videos but not too much because they are  incredibly rare individuals whose  abilities aren't  uh well they're not particularly  versatile however with that said there  is still quite the call for near nexus  due to another sub-branch of the art  form which is known as nen curses and  i've done a whole  video on them link in the description  below if you're keen to learn more but a  basic example of a nen curse would be  krapik's judgment chain  which was used on three members of the  phantom troop and resulted in the deaths  of two  meanwhile other curses include gentry's  countdown and even nakosakawara falls  under the category of nen curse despite  the fact that it is also a nen beast  interestingly but despite the fact that  the existence of nen  is one of the best kept secrets in the  world the fact that curses exist  has given rise to a response to them  which has taken its form in the realm of  exorcism and to explore this some more  let's head over to our first and most  profound example of a nan  exorcist being ambengano now we know  this fine fellow from the other divisive  greed island arc which actually features  an entire subplot based on nern exorcism  and that is an aspect of greed island i  feel often gets quite forgotten  in favor of remembering some glorious  dodgeball but the entire reason why both  hisoka and the phantom troupe were  involved here at all was the search for  an nx cyst  in order to remove karapica's judgement  chain from crowler and i think that very  much goes on to display how  rare these practitioners are because it  would seem that if you want an  organization like say the hunter  association  it turns out that it is no simple task  to source a nan exorcist so much so the  phantom troop had to resort to delving  into a game to do so however as for  abengana himself he would be the first  to display the basic way in which nan  exorcism technically works which does  vary depending on your nan affinity in  our benghani's case he is a conjurer so  his brand of exorcism will make use of  conjuration  which is not necessarily true in every  other case but basically in order to  remove a curse ambengano has the  condition of setting up something of a  ritual whereby he needs to start a  campfire  as well as construct an effigy and  engage in prayer to the forest spirits  and with that in mind i assume that  abengana also needs to be in a forest  to perform a nexus however i would say  that we should not be confused by the  the theatricality of this setup it's  more than likely that these are  limitations that arben ghana has  subconsciously imposed on himself  in order to engage with his abilities  which may even go on to make his  exorcisms more powerful or efficient  than that of others  mostly because i highly highly doubt  that given everything we know of the  hunt hunt world that there is a more  spiritual element to it and as such this  whole ritual business is more than  likely a result of abengane's background  however religious  or traditionalists that may be in any  case as we would soon learn an exorcism  is not a simple removal or dispelling of  indian curse  sadly nen doesn't exactly work like that  and the power inflicted upon a victim by  an n curse more accurately needs to be  traded in for something else  which unfortunately for the existing  question will generally be inflicting  them  rather than the initial curse victim so  remember when i said that abengano was a  conjurer well the result of him removing  an incurs is that he goes on to conjure  and then beast the size of which is in  direct correlation to the power of the  curse removed and rather  awkwardly that beast then attaches  itself to abungani until the original  conditions of said curse  are met now conditions on a curse look  most name curses come with a crafted  limitation  by the creator to make them more  powerful and the beast you are seeing on  our benghani was created by removing  genthru's countdown ability which  charbon gun it did claim was quite  powerful  i guess implying that the majority of  nanexisms probably would not result in a  beast quite this big but genthru's  countdown did have a condition for  removal which is that the target has to  touch again through himself and say i  caught the bomber at which point the  countdown hatsu will vanish entirely  so that's the very tricky tricky balance  of not just being in a nexus but  engaging in a nexism because in some way  or another the exorcist will be  sacrificing their own well-being for the  sake of an afflicted victim and to put  it another way they will basically be  inflicting themselves with the same  curse but just in a different form  now i mention conditions for curses  because this becomes very fascinating  to think about in regards to abengane's  next exorcism which would be removing  karopika's judgment chain from kroller  now sadly this would be an exorcism that  we did not get to see with our own eyes  however we do know for a fact that it  happened because sabangana left greed  island with hisoka  claiming that he was about to make an  absolute fortune on a nexism and then  the next time we see crollo well he is  back in action and able to use then  again as well as contact the other troop  members now i don't think that there is  any dispute the judgement chain is just  empirically more powerful than countdown  which means that the nen beast that  would have needed to be conjured by  abangana as a result  would have been a much more massive than  this comparatively teeny tiny thing that  we saw on greed island but the thing i  do worry about most though is that yes  the judgment chain has conditions  in which kravika gets to inflict rules  on his targets however this curse does  not have a condition  under which it can be dispelled at least  not one that we know of and this of  course  is intentionally constructed by karapika  because he planned on using it to take  revenge on the troop and so he did not  want to give them any way out however  that puts abengana in a rather rough  position because after successfully  performing this exorcism it could very  well have left him with no way to dispel  the curse that he had taken upon himself  and i mean yes he at the very least  assumedly does not have crawler's  conditions imposed on him but i don't  see how it would have been possible for  him to rid himself  of the conjugand beast and also this  assumes that abengane survived the  exorcism process to begin with another  rather unfortunate aspect about abengan  abengane's nernexism  is that he does not become aware of  exactly how powerful the nenenkus is  until he engages in the process by which  point it is far  far too late to do anything about it so  he has to use very clear judgment before  beginning in axism  which he does seem to have as he did  correctly gauge the strength of gentru's  curse but then again that curse was  inflicted upon upping ghana directly  whereas the judgment chain was on  another person which would have  potentially made it much harder for  abangani to gain an accurate reflection  of power so i guess what i'm suggesting  is that it's entirely possible that arba  ghana currently lives in a state of  living hell with a gigantic beast upon  him that he is unable to remove  or that maybe armangana had to conjure  an nb so large that it crushed and  killed him but in any case i don't think  things worked out particularly well for  this  individual nan exorcist so let's put  amangana to the side and look at another  exorcist another often forgotten example  from the chimera antarctic being hina  who was a squad captain under lao's  command who also just so happened to be  an  cyst now in hina's case she was a  specialist so it's very hard to dissect  exactly how she technically uses her  abilities but they have a very distinct  correlation to abagana's powers which is  that after removing a curse ina takes  that power onto herself which in this  case inflates her stomach with the  amount of inflation being related to the  potency of the curse  now as for what cursed in the series  hina removed well she was actually  responsible for freeing chitu from  knuckles hakuwara which is another very  powerful curse and the more i think  about hakuwa the crazier it becomes  so it had the effect of making hina look  like she was well  pretty desperately pregnant very  interestingly though this was an awkward  situation for hina because the condition  for removing hakuwa was to pay back the  aura loaned by knuckle which she most  certainly never did and in fact i don't  think the two of them were  ever anywhere near each other but hina  would recover anyway very coincidentally  right after chi 2 was sorted by silva  zoldick which provides us with another  fascinating interaction because despite  taking the curse upon herself  it would seem that the curse was still  tied to its original target  so once chitu was removed from this  world the curse was taken along with it  now i definitely can't say if this would  be the case for all nenexis for example  if crowler were to die  then would arbengana if indeed he was  still alive immediately have his  conjured end beast removed as a result  it's mostly difficult to say because  once again hina was a specialist so she  could have had a very unique condition  in play that keeps the connection to her  target however there is admittedly a  possibility that this could be a  universal standard of existence now  sadly we have very few other examples of  nenexist and much less specific  abilities but in the manga we do have a  confirmed exorcist in umama who is the  bodyguard of second prince camilla in  the succession war although we  ultimately know nothing about her at  this stage other than the fact that she  can  indeed engage in this art form which  actually makes camilla's faction far  more dangerous than anybody gives her  credit for  because it is a super super handy thing  to have a nexus by your side  elsewhere in the succession war you  could potentially make the argument that  rehan's predator ability is a form of no  nexism although it is quite a flimsy  case i mean under the right conditions  it does counter and remove non-abilities  which was seen in the case of 8th prince  salazar beast and it did have  repercussions on rihann himself which  was simply that he was unable  to use nen for 48 hours after predator  had acted but at the same time that  could just be a basic known limitation  so look it might be a very different  brand of excision or an entirely new  subclass of nine all on its own and some  people may also remember the axis that  was brought in to help gone after the  events of the chimera antar  and this would be the individual who  claimed that there was no exorcist in  existence that could remove the curse  that gon had placed on himself which  makes a lot of sense because this is by  far the most powerful use of nen that we  have ever seen in the series and as such  it came with an equal amount of  consequences this does bring up an  important factor which is that nexus  also run into a problem with post-mortem  nancosas in general because they are by  nature's superpowered effects of aura  that far surpass the general  capabilities of living end wielders with  that said post-mortem then is not  impossible to deal with  unlike gone's situation but it has been  quite literally stated that there are  less than 10 exodus in this world who  have the ability to remove a curse  invoked with post-mortem nine and the  hunter who was engaged to trick gone may  very well be one of those  because she was a seemingly highly  trusted member of the association but  this does go on to imply that there are  some very  like extraordinarily powerful people out  there that we very much have yet to meet  and what's also interesting to think  about  is if you need to access a particular  affinity of nen to develop an x-ismhatsu  so the two examples that we've seen  conjuration and specialization while  they make all the sense in the world  because they can take that curse aura  and convert it into something else  however not all nem branches can  necessarily serve that function for  example enhancement and manipulation and  two disciplines that i would say are  unlikely to be able to access sexism but  not  impossible like perhaps maybe a curse  could be removed and inflicted upon your  body in the case of an enhancer they do  very much see emitters and transmuters  being able to perform xs-0 because they  can very deliberately mould their aurora  like a transmuter could create a cursed  substance that follows them perhaps even  a raw name beast to compensate but in  the end the whole exorcist curse dynamic  is one of those fantastically underrated  features of hunter hunter and it does  add a great layer of depth to the  empower system  as well as the world itself actually and  the rarity of such figures and events  only serves to make them far more  captivating when they do  indeed happen in the series and that  pretty much does it for this discussion  of net exorcisms but what do you guys  think please do leave your thoughts in  the comments below or even join my  discord server and if you're game for  some more hunt onto content then please  do go and check out some of my other  videos or even subscribe to the channel  for regular hunt hunter glory delivered  straight into your youtube feed but for  now this has been the new world review  and i'll see you next time

